    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>265648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>道具屋　天地無用</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Item Shop - The Rightside Up</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい、ここは
道具屋「天地無用」
ほしいもんは遠慮なく言っとくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, this is the item shop, "The
Rightside Up." If there's anything
you'd like, be sure and let me know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>安く提供させてもらってるよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've got the cheapest
offers you'll find~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はこのお店で
アルバイトとして働いてる
サッチです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm Sacchi. I work
here part-time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんまりもうかってないのに、
働かせてもらってるのって
なんか悪い気がするけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This shop doesn't make a lot of
money, but the owner lets me work
here anyway... I feel kinda bad...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私、ご主人のご厚意で
ここで働かせてもらってます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The owner graciously
allows me to work here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なかなか働き口がないので、
助かってます。だからお給料が
安くても文句は言いません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There really aren't many job openings,
so it's a big help. So much so that I
won't complain about the low pay.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このお店、正直、あんまり
もうかっていません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To be frank, this shop
isn't selling much product.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そりゃそうですよね、
この貧しい村の人相手に
商売してるんですもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's about what you'd
expect, right? Our clientele *are*
people of an impoverished village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村の貧しい人相手の商売は
正直、あまり割のいいものでは
ありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Frankly speaking, selling
to poverty-stricken villagers
is not very profitable.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それでもこの店がなくなると
困る人はいるのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But some people would be
worse off if not for this shop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そのために店続けるなんて、
この店の主人、本当に人が
いいのよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's really kind of the
owner to keep this shop
open just for their sake.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はここでお金を貯めて
いつかアルヴァニスタへ
行くつもり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My plan is to save up my
wages from here and move
to Alvanista someday.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルヴァニスタへ行って、
小さいけれど、安らげる
素敵なお店を経営するの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once I'm in Alvanista, well, it'll have
to be small, but I'll run a wonderfully
cosy little shop of my own.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村で唯一の雑貨店
「天地無用」へようこそ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome to the village's sole
general store, "The Rightside Up."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は売店のサッチです。
特にモデルはいません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm Sacchi of the Shop. I'm
really not inspired by anything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>はい、道具屋「天地無用」。
いい品揃ってるよ、
自信あるよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, we're the item shop, "The
Rightside Up." I've got confidence
in our products~ They're great~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ケチケチしないで、
さぁ買ってった買ってった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't be a cheapskate. C'mon,
buy something! Buy something!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>冷やかしは
お断りだよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Absolutely no
window shopping~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シグルドから村が解放されたと
聞いて、この村につい最近、
やって来たのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I came here just recently,
after hearing the village had
been liberated from Sigurd.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フロンティアスピリッツって
ヤツだ、これからは裸一貫で
始めて、大きくなる時代だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's the pioneer spirit. We'll
start here, from nothing,
and build our way up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーん……この店、
少し高いな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... Isn't this shop
a little too expensive?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>君たちみたいな金を持ってる
奴はいいけど、裸一貫で来た
俺ら貧乏人には優しくないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's fine for people like yourselves, who
have plenty of to spend, but it's not
so nice for penniless paupers like me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村で生活を一から
始めようと思ったんだが
生活の準備をするのも一苦労だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I thought I'd start life in this village
from zero, but even putting together
the necessities will be a lot of work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれやこれや、
全部揃えなくちゃならない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll need a little of this,
and a little of that... And
it all has to be done.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんなことなら
来るんじゃなかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If it's going to be like this, I
should never have come here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>生活がきつい……
いや、壁は高いからこそ
登りがいがあるのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Life is harsh... But well,
hurdles are worth jumping
*because* they're high.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレはこの村で
一旗上げて故郷に
錦を飾るのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll plant my flag here
and when I do go back
home, it'll be in triumph.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレの夢を馬鹿にした
家族と友人たちを
見返すのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And all my family and friends
who called my dreams foolish?
I'll make them eat those words.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村に来て、早１か月……
これと言って何も
しないまま、過ぎてしまった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's already been a full month since
I came here... And in all that time,
I haven't really accomplished anything...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一体、この村で
何をなせるというのだろう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell am I
even doing out here...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>採掘者募集とかあったけど
オレは石ころ掘りたい
わけじゃない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They've been recruiting miners,
but I don't really want to
spend my days digging up rocks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一発当てるためには
一体、どうすりゃ
いいんだー！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was planning to knock this
outta the park, but where
the hell should I even start!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
